{"id": "c21", "kind": "numeric", "text": "200,000줄 코드베이스를 3시간 안에, Opus 5 는 20시간 넘게 토큰 2.5배; HAProxy C→Rust 에서 9.5시간 대 12시간, 비용 51% 절감 (09장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "w1 §Coding ¶1", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§Coding ¶1", "quote": "An early tester used it to audit and fix a 200,000-line codebase in under three hours, where Opus 5 took over 20 hours and used 2.5x as many tokens."}, {"source": "w1", "locator": "§Coding ¶1", "quote": "Opus 5.5 finished in 9.5 hours compared to 12 for Fable 5.1, and cost 51% less."}]}
{"id": "c22", "kind": "numeric", "text": "고객 인용: Quantium 38 프롬프트·4일 → 11 프롬프트·3시간, Optiver 비용 40~50% 절감, Kiro 호출 약 40% 감소·토큰 절반, Lovable 스텝 1/3~1/2 감소 (09장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "w1 §Coding 고객 인용", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§Coding · Quantium quote", "quote": "A complex coding task that previously took 38 prompts over four days came in at 11 prompts over three hours"}, {"source": "w1", "locator": "§Coding · Optiver quote", "quote": "cutting the cost of that workload by 40 to 50%"}, {"source": "w1", "locator": "§Coding · Kiro quote", "quote": "while making about 40% fewer calls and using half the tokens"}, {"source": "w1", "locator": "§Coding · Lovable quote", "quote": "finishing in a third to half fewer steps and using significantly fewer tokens along the way"}]}
{"id": "c23", "kind": "web", "text": "원문: prompt injection 에서 시험한 모든 설정에서 Opus 5 와 같거나 낫고 Gray Swan 벤치마크에서 Fable 5.1 과 함께 최저 성공률 (10장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "w1 §The most secure coding agent ¶2", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§The most secure coding agent ¶2", "quote": "On prompt injection attacks, it matches or beats Opus 5 in every setting we tested, including coding, tool use, computer use, and web browsing. On a benchmark run by the AI security firm Gray Swan, Opus 5.5 ties Fable 5.1 for the lowest prompt injection success rate of any model tested."}]}
{"id": "c24", "kind": "numeric", "text": "시스템 카드 §5.2.1: 공격 성공률 k=1 0.1%, k=10 0.7%, k=15 1.0%; Opus 5 는 0.4%, 3.6%, 4.8% (10장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "s1 §5.2.1 p.85", "evidence": [{"source": "s1", "locator": "§5.2.1 p.85", "quote": "with an attack success rate of 0.1% at k=1, 0.7% at k=10, and 1.0% at k=15. This improves on Claude Opus 5 (0.4%, 3.6%, and 4.8%, respectively)."}]}
{"id": "c25", "kind": "web", "text": "시스템 카드: 행동 감사에서 prompt injection 은 작은 퇴보이고, 사용자가 붙여넣은 텍스트 속 악의적 지시를 이전 모델보다 더 잘 따른다 (10·21장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "s1 §6.4.1 p.105, Executive Summary p.2", "evidence": [{"source": "s1", "locator": "§6.4.1 p.105", "quote": "Exceptions included prompt injection, where we saw a genuine but small regression, which we cover with a dedicated evaluation in Section 6.5.1"}, {"source": "s1", "locator": "Executive Summary p.2", "quote": "it is more likely than previous models to follow malicious instructions in text that a user pastes into their own prompt"}]}
{"id": "c26", "kind": "numeric", "text": "보고서 시험 18회 중 16회 통과, Fable 5.1·Opus 5 는 0회; 합병 분석 63분 대 93분, 비용 50% 절감; GDPval 1846 Elo, 44개 직업 (11장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "w1 §Knowledge work", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§Knowledge work ¶1", "quote": "16 out of 18 of Opus 5.5’s reports cleared our quality bar, where any invented figure or quote would have failed. Neither Fable 5.1 nor Opus 5 cleared that bar in any attempt."}, {"source": "w1", "locator": "§Knowledge work ¶3", "quote": "Opus 5.5 finished in 63 minutes compared to 93 for Opus 5, and cost 50% less to produce."}, {"source": "w1", "locator": "§Knowledge work ¶4", "quote": "On GDPval-AA v2.1, a test of real-world work across 44 occupations, Opus 5.5 scores 1846 Elo"}]}
