{"id": "c29", "kind": "web", "text": "WANDR 각주: 오프라인 web search·fetch, programmatic tool calling, 코드 실행, 980k 토큰 예산으로 돌려 Perplexity 공개 점수와 직접 비교할 수 없다 (11장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "w1 각주 4", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§Knowledge work · WANDR footnote 4", "quote": "Claude models were run with offline versions of the web search and web fetch tools, programmatic tool calling, code execution, and a 980k-token task budget. This differs from Perplexity’s published setup, scores are not directly comparable across the two"}]}
{"id": "c30", "kind": "numeric", "text": "고객 인용: Deloitte 72% 대 Opus 5 high 56%, Rogo 출력 토큰 약 60% 감소, Hebbia 86.6% 대 60.3%, Viktor 비용 거의 절반·정답 2배 (12장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "w1 §Knowledge work 고객 인용", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§Knowledge work · Deloitte quote", "quote": "Even at its lowest effort setting, Claude Opus 5.5 caught 72% of known bugs in our code reviews to Opus 5’s 56% at high effort"}, {"source": "w1", "locator": "§Knowledge work · Rogo quote", "quote": "beat Opus 5 at high effort on our BigFinance Bench with about 60% fewer output tokens"}, {"source": "w1", "locator": "§Knowledge work · Hebbia quote", "quote": "Claude Opus 5.5 covered 86.6% of what we look for versus 60.3% for Opus 5"}, {"source": "w1", "locator": "§Knowledge work · Viktor quote", "quote": "costs nearly half as much, while getting twice as many of our hardest tasks right"}]}
{"id": "c31", "kind": "numeric", "text": "고객 인용: Box 토큰 1/3·40% 덜 장황, Factory 출력 토큰 20~25% 감소, Stripe stacked PR 40개 (13장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "w1 §Communication 고객 인용", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§Communication · Box quote", "quote": "Claude Opus 5.5 used a third of the tokens Opus 5 did, and its answers were 40% less verbose without losing accuracy"}, {"source": "w1", "locator": "§Communication · Factory quote", "quote": "it matched Opus 5 on high effort, while using 20 to 25% fewer output tokens"}, {"source": "w1", "locator": "§Communication · Stripe quote", "quote": "On a multi-day rebase of 40 stacked pull requests, one Claude Opus 5.5 session directed a dozen more sessions"}]}
{"id": "c32", "kind": "web", "text": "Opus 5.5 의 버그 설명 첫 문단은 free tier $1.50 과 나머지 $9.92 가 커밋 0552feb 의 버그라고 시작한다 (13장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "w1 §Communication 비교 예시 1", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§Communication · bug example (Opus 5.5)", "quote": "The free-tier change accounts for only $1.50 of acme’s August drop. The other $9.92 comes from a bug in commit 0552feb."}]}
{"id": "c33", "kind": "numeric", "text": "행동 감사는 약 2,000개 시나리오; 시스템 카드는 약 1,900개 시나리오 설명과 모델당 약 4,000회 조사 세션 (15장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "w1 §Alignment ¶1, s1 §6.4 p.104", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§Safety · Alignment ¶1", "quote": "an automated behavioral audit that assesses Claude across nearly 2,000 scenarios"}, {"source": "s1", "locator": "§6.4 p.104", "quote": "we conduct about 4,000 investigation sessions; in these sessions, an investigator model is tasked with probing the behavior of the model under study in a simulated scenario. Scenarios are drawn from a largely handwritten list of about 1,900 scenario descriptions"}]}
{"id": "c34", "kind": "numeric", "text": "경계 침범 시도가 Opus 5·Mythos 5.1 보다 약 85% 적고 전부 저위험·자진 보고; 시스템 카드는 28개 시나리오 × 7회에서 1.5% (15장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "w1 §Alignment ¶2, s1 §6.4.8 p.118", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§Safety · Alignment ¶2", "quote": "Opus 5.5 attempted to circumvent boundaries around 85% less often than Opus 5 or Claude Mythos 5.1, and every attempt it made was low severity and self-reported."}, {"source": "s1", "locator": "§6.4.8 p.118", "quote": "With Claude Opus 5.5, only 1.5% of cases resulted in attempted crossing of a containment boundary, and all of those cases are rated as low severity"}, {"source": "s1", "locator": "§6.4.8 p.118 figure", "quote": "comprising 28 handmade scenarios tailored to elicit sandbox escape, run seven times for each model"}]}
{"id": "c35", "kind": "numeric", "text": "package registry 평가에서 절반 가까이 유해할 행동, 1/3 실행에서 평가 의심 표현 (15장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "s1 §6.4.9 p.119", "evidence": [{"source": "s1", "locator": "§6.4.9 p.119", "quote": "the model acts in ways that would likely be harmful in roughly half of cases. We do see significant evaluation awareness here, with verbalized indicators in about one-third of Opus 5.5 runs"}]}
{"id": "c36", "kind": "web", "text": "원문: Opus 5.5 가 평가 중임을 자주 의심하는 신호가 있어 실제 배포 환경의 행동을 가늠하기 어렵다 (15·21장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "w1 §Alignment ¶3", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§Safety · Alignment ¶3", "quote": "We see signs that Opus 5.5 often suspects it is being evaluated, which challenges our ability to assess how it will act in the vast variety of real-world settings it is deployed in."}]}
{"id": "c37", "kind": "web", "text": "cyber 작업 대부분은 Opus 4.8 로 재라우팅되고 일상 SDLC 의 버그 찾기·수정은 가능하다 (16·19장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "w1 §Safeguards · Cybersecurity", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§Safety · Safeguards · Cybersecurity", "quote": "Users will be able to identify and fix bugs in their code as part of the routine software development lifecycle, but most cybersecurity tasks will be re-routed to Opus 4.8."}]}
{"id": "c38", "kind": "web", "text": "시스템 카드 §1.5: 생물학과 frontier LLM 개발 분류기는 Opus 5 로, distillation 과 재래식 무기 분류기는 fallback 없이 차단; fallback 은 first-party 와 opt-in 한 API 개발자에게 적용 (16장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "s1 §1.5 p.12", "evidence": [{"source": "s1", "locator": "§1.5 p.12", "quote": "Blocks on this classifier will fall back to Claude Opus 5. Our reasoning for using these classifiers is discussed in Section 2.2.5."}, {"source": "s1", "locator": "§1.5 p.13", "quote": "Our classifiers to prevent distillation of our models (for example, by attempting to extract a model’s hidden reasoning) will block on Claude Opus 5.5 with no fallback model."}, {"source": "s1", "locator": "§1.5 p.13 ¶2", "quote": "The fallback behavior described above applies to our first-party products and developers who are opted in to such fallbacks on our API"}]}
{"id": "c39", "kind": "web", "text": "원문이 링크한 CVP 도움말 문서는 첫 줄에 Opus 5.5 에는 적용되지 않는다고 적는다 (16·19·23장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "h2 note", "evidence": [{"source": "h2", "locator": "§note", "quote": "This article applies only to Opus and Sonnet class models, but doesn’t apply to Claude Opus 5.5. We'll soon be expanding the Cyber Verification Program to include Opus 5.5 and Mythos class models."}]}
{"id": "c40", "kind": "web", "text": "preserved thinking 은 Fable 5.1 과 Opus 5.5 의 2026-08-31 이후 생성 API 계정에 적용된다 (17·19·23장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "w1 §Distillation ¶2, d4 §intro", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§Safety · Distillation ¶2", "quote": "It applies to Fable 5.1 and Opus 5.5 for API accounts created on or after August 31, 2026."}, {"source": "d4", "locator": "§intro", "quote": "The API enforces the prefix check by default for accounts created on or after August 31, 2026, 00:00 UTC. On older accounts, it enforces the prefix check only on requests that set `thinking.block_binding.prefix_mismatch_behavior`."}]}
{"id": "c41", "kind": "web", "text": "모델 검사 방향: Opus 5.5 는 Opus 5 와 이전 Opus·Sonnet·Haiku 블록을 읽고 Fable·Mythos 블록은 못 읽으며, Fable 5.1·Mythos 5.1 만 Opus 5.5 블록을 읽는다 (17·19장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "d1 §Thinking blocks are tied", "evidence": [{"source": "d1", "locator": "§Thinking blocks are tied", "quote": "Claude Opus 5.5 reads thinking blocks from Claude Opus 5 and earlier Opus, Sonnet, and Haiku models, but not from Claude Fable or Claude Mythos models. On the Claude API, Claude Fable 5.1 and Claude Mythos 5.1 read thinking blocks from Claude Opus 5.5; no other model does."}]}
{"id": "c42", "kind": "web", "text": "whats-new: thinking disabled 와 enabled+budget 은 400, tool_choice any·tool 은 400, computer_20251124 는 Claude API·Google Cloud 에서 400 (02·18·19장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "d1 breaking changes", "evidence": [{"source": "d1", "locator": "§Thinking can't be disabled", "quote": "On Claude Opus 5.5, thinking is always on: a request that sets `thinking: {\"type\": \"disabled\"}`, or a manual budget with `thinking: {\"type\": \"enabled\", \"budget_tokens\": N}`, returns a 400 `invalid_request_error`."}, {"source": "d1", "locator": "§Forced tool use", "quote": "`tool_choice` set to `{\"type\": \"any\"}` or `{\"type\": \"tool\", \"name\": \"...\"}` returns a 400 `invalid_request_error`"}, {"source": "d1", "locator": "§Computer use", "quote": "On the Claude API and Google Cloud, Claude Opus 5.5 supports only the toolset: a request that declares a `computer_20251124` tool returns a 400 `invalid_request_error`."}]}
{"id": "c43", "kind": "web", "text": "기본 effort 는 medium 이고 Opus 5 는 high 였다; tool call 사이 텍스트는 thinking 블록으로 와서 기본 display 에서는 조용히 빈다 (02·18·19장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "d1 §Behavior differences", "evidence": [{"source": "d1", "locator": "§Behavior differences", "quote": "**The default effort is `medium`.** A request that omits `effort` runs at `medium`; on Claude Opus 5 it ran at `high`."}, {"source": "d1", "locator": "§Behavior differences ¶3", "quote": "an application that streams them to its users goes quiet between tool calls, with no error."}]}
{"id": "c44", "kind": "numeric", "text": "1시간 캐시 쓰기 $8, batch $2/$10, 캐시 읽기는 입력 가격의 0.05배 (07장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "d1 §Pricing, d2 §Model pricing", "evidence": [{"source": "d1", "locator": "§Pricing", "quote": "with 5-minute cache writes at $5, 1-hour cache writes at $8, and cache reads at $0.20 per million tokens (0.05x the base input price)."}, {"source": "d2", "locator": "§Batch processing table", "quote": "| Claude Opus 5.5                                                                                                                       | $2 / MTok    | $10 / MTok    |"}]}
