{"id": "c48", "kind": "web", "text": "HN mintik 은 cyber 분류기 오탐으로 임베디드·드라이버 작업을 하나도 못 마쳤다고, arw0n 은 오탐이 훨씬 줄었다고 같은 스레드에 썼다 (22장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "c1 comments 49808591, 49804997", "evidence": [{"source": "c1", "locator": "comment 49808591 (mintik, 2026-09-22T21:44Z)", "quote": "[cyber] classifier is incredibly sensitive with Opus 5.5 I cannot complete any embedded/driver/system-level tasks."}, {"source": "c1", "locator": "comment 49804997 (arw0n, 2026-09-22T17:29Z)", "quote": "It has far less false positives now, and generally accepts defensive requests."}]}
