{"id": "c52", "kind": "derived", "text": "같은 effort 에서 태스크당 비용: high 는 TB4 $3.88 vs $10.64 (−64%), FC $1.09 vs $7.62 (−86%), CB $3.97 vs $9.00 (−56%), GDPval $1.54 vs $3.03 (−49%), AutomationBench $0.70 vs $1.03 (−32%), WANDR $16.88 vs $43.49 (−61%); max 는 TB4 −29%, FC −50%, CB +12%, GDPval +32%, AutomationBench +8%, WANDR −38% (02·07·19·21·23장)", "scope": "원문 차트 점에서 계산", "derived_from": ["notes/figures.md 의 Opus 5.5 와 Opus 5 의 high·max 점 12쌍"], "note": "원문은 같은 effort 끼리의 비교를 적지 않는다. 절감률 = 1 − Opus 5.5 비용 / Opus 5 비용", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "Terminal-Bench 4.0 chart (aria-label; notes/figures.md)", "quote": "Opus 5.5 · high: 64.2% $3.88 / Opus 5.5 · max: 64.8% $11.24 / Opus 5 · high: 47.0% $10.64 / Opus 5 · max: 52.3% $15.83"}, {"source": "w1", "locator": "CursorBench 4.0 chart (aria-label; notes/figures.md)", "quote": "Opus 5.5 · high: 56.0% $3.97 / Opus 5.5 · max: 57.8% $13.43 / Opus 5 · high: 44.7% $9 / Opus 5 · max: 46.6% $11.95"}, {"source": "w1", "locator": "GDPval-AA v2.1 chart (aria-label; notes/figures.md)", "quote": "Opus 5.5 · high: 1692 $1.54 / Opus 5.5 · max: 1846 $8.92 / Opus 5 · high: 1581 $3.03 / Opus 5 · max: 1708 $6.76"}, {"source": "w1", "locator": "FrontierCode v1.1 chart (aria-label; notes/figures.md)", "quote": "Opus 5.5 · high: 54.0% $1.09 / Opus 5.5 · max: 54.4% $6.19 / Opus 5 · high: 48.0% $7.62 / Opus 5 · max: 48.0% $12.28"}, {"source": "w1", "locator": "AutomationBench chart (aria-label; notes/figures.md)", "quote": "Opus 5.5 · high: 32.0% $0.70 / Opus 5.5 · max: 40.0% $1.37 / Opus 5 · high: 20.6% $1.03 / Opus 5 · max: 26.9% $1.27"}, {"source": "w1", "locator": "WANDR chart (aria-label; notes/figures.md)", "quote": "Opus 5.5 · high: 67.3% $16.88 / Opus 5.5 · max: 72.3% $37.92 / Opus 5 · high: 64.6% $43.49 / Opus 5 · max: 67.2% $61.62"}], "verdict": "confirmed"}
{"id": "c53", "kind": "derived", "text": "medium 에서 high 로 올리면 비용이 TB4 1.3배, FC 1.4배, CB 1.4배에 점수는 +6.6pt, −0.6pt, +3.5pt; FrontierCode medium 끼리는 Opus 5.5 $0.80 대 Opus 5 $4.61 로 1/5.8 (06·08·23장)", "scope": "원문 차트 점에서 계산", "derived_from": ["TB4 3.88/2.94, 64.2−57.6", "FC 1.09/0.80, 54.0−54.6", "CB 3.97/2.90, 56.0−52.5", "FC Opus 5 med $4.61 / Opus 5.5 med $0.80"], "note": "원문에 없는 계산. 3.88/2.94=1.32, 1.09/0.80=1.36, 3.97/2.90=1.37, 4.61/0.80=5.76", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "FrontierCode v1.1 chart (aria-label; notes/figures.md)", "quote": "Opus 5.5 · med: 54.6% $0.80 / Opus 5.5 · high: 54.0% $1.09 / Opus 5 · med: 53.4% $4.61"}, {"source": "w1", "locator": "Terminal-Bench 4.0 chart (aria-label; notes/figures.md)", "quote": "Opus 5.5 · med: 57.6% $2.94 / Opus 5.5 · high: 64.2% $3.88"}], "verdict": "confirmed"}
{"id": "c54", "kind": "web", "text": "Opus 5.5 retirement 는 2027-09-22 이전에는 없고(Claude API·Claude Platform on AWS·Foundry 기준) Opus 5 는 legacy 로 계속 제공된다 (18·19장)", "scope": "d3 모델 비교표와 legacy 목록", "evidence": [{"source": "d3", "locator": "§Model comparison table · Retirement", "quote": "| [Retirement](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations)                         | Not sooner than September 1, 2027                                                 | Not sooner than September 22, 2027"}, {"source": "d3", "locator": "§Model comparison table · Retirement note", "quote": "**Retirement:** Anthropic’s commitment for Anthropic-operated platforms (Claude API, Claude Platform on AWS, Microsoft Foundry). Amazon Bedrock and Google Cloud set their own dates."}, {"source": "d3", "locator": "§Legacy models", "quote": "Legacy models (still available): [Claude Fable 5](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/fable-5/overview), [Claude Opus 5](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/opus-5/overview)"}], "verdict": "confirmed"}
