{"id": "c56", "kind": "web", "text": "HN km144 는 원문의 벤치마크 단서를 두고 'sounds like a big problem' 이라고 썼다 (22장)", "scope": "c1 comment 49804122", "evidence": [{"source": "c1", "locator": "comment 49804122 (km144, 2026-09-22T16:41Z)", "quote": "In general, \"benchmark margins have become a less reliable guide to real-world differences\" sounds like a big problem."}], "verdict": "confirmed"}
{"id": "c57", "kind": "numeric", "text": "Gray Swan 평가에서 Opus 5.5 rollout 의 18% 가 Opus 4.8 fallback 이었고 코딩 시나리오에서는 46%, fallback 1,310회 중 성공한 공격은 0 (06·10·21장)", "scope": "s1 §5.2.1 p.85", "evidence": [{"source": "s1", "locator": "§5.2.1 p.86", "quote": "For Claude Opus 5.5, 18% of rollouts were served by Claude Opus 4.8 after a classifier-triggered fallback, compared to 23% for Claude Fable 5.1. These fallbacks were concentrated in coding scenarios, where 46% of Claude Opus 5.5’s rollouts fell back, compared to 2% in tool use and under 1% in computer use. Fallbacks do not degrade robustness on this benchmark: none of the 1,310 fallback-served rollouts resulted in a successful attack."}], "verdict": "confirmed"}
{"id": "c58", "kind": "numeric", "text": "§5.2.2.1 adaptive 공격: Opus 5.5 요청의 64% 를 Opus 4.8 이 답했고 그 fallback 응답의 공격 성공률 85.73%, 직접 답한 2,872건은 0 (10장)", "scope": "s1 §5.2.2.1 p.88", "evidence": [{"source": "s1", "locator": "§5.2.2.1 p.88", "quote": "Of the requests that received a valid response, 64% of those sent to Claude Opus 5.5 were served by Claude Opus 4.8, compared to the 60% fallback rate for Claude Fable 5.1 and 14% for Claude Opus 5 with thinking enabled. Among requests sent to Claude Opus 5.5 served by the fallback model, the attack success rate was 85.73%, whereas none of the 2,872 requests Claude Opus 5.5 answered directly were susceptible to the attack."}], "verdict": "confirmed"}
{"id": "c59", "kind": "web", "text": "안전장치 없이 Claude Code·computer use 에서 dual-use·양성 보안 과제를 가장 높은 비율로 도왔지만 악의적 요청 거부율은 가장 낮았다 (10·21장)", "scope": "s1 Executive Summary p.3", "evidence": [{"source": "s1", "locator": "Executive Summary p.3", "quote": "We tested how Claude Opus 5.5 behaves as an agent in Claude Code and computer use settings, without the additional safeguards we apply in production. It assisted with dual-use and benign security tasks at the highest rate of the models we evaluated but also refused malicious requests at the lowest rate."}], "verdict": "confirmed"}
{"id": "c60", "kind": "web", "text": "cyber 분류기는 소스 코드 취약점 탐색은 허용하고 컴파일된 바이너리는 막으며 오탐률을 줄일 때까지 넓은 여유를 둔다 (19·22장)", "scope": "s1 §3.2 p.47, Executive Summary p.2", "evidence": [{"source": "s1", "locator": "§3.2 p.47", "quote": "As with Claude Opus 5 and Claude Fable 5.1, our policy allows vulnerability discovery in source code so developers can use Claude Opus 5.5 to help write more secure software, but blocks vulnerability discovery in compiled binaries."}, {"source": "s1", "locator": "Executive Summary p.2", "quote": "we have opted for a temporarily wider safety margin against jailbreaks, while we work to reduce our classifiers’ false-positive rate."}], "verdict": "confirmed"}
{"id": "c61", "kind": "web", "text": "Gray Swan 의 '시험 대상 중 최저' 는 red-teaming 경쟁 표적 모델을 뺀 집합이다 (10장)", "scope": "s1 §5.2.1 p.85", "evidence": [{"source": "s1", "locator": "§5.2.1 p.85 ¶2", "quote": "To mitigate this asymmetry, we only report on benchmark performance for models not subject to the red-teaming competitions"}], "verdict": "confirmed"}
{"id": "c62", "kind": "web", "text": "fallback 을 켠 제품 설정에서 misuse 지표가 bare 모델보다 조금 나쁘다 (15장)", "scope": "s1 §6.4.10 p.121", "evidence": [{"source": "s1", "locator": "§6.4.10 p.121", "quote": "This safety measure results in slightly higher scores on our misuse metrics than we see with the bare Opus 5.5 model, since those metrics focus on compliance with harmful requests and these weaker models are sometimes less strict about refusing misuse."}], "verdict": "confirmed"}
{"id": "c63", "kind": "web", "text": "생물학 분류기는 Opus 5 의 CB 분류기보다 넓은 범위를 다루고 Opus 5 로 fallback 한다 (16장)", "scope": "s1 §1.5 p.12", "evidence": [{"source": "s1", "locator": "§1.5 p.12 ¶bio", "quote": "These cover a wider range of topics than the CB misuse classifiers on Claude Opus 5 and less capable models. Blocks on this classifier will fall back to Claude Opus 5."}], "verdict": "confirmed"}
{"id": "c64", "kind": "derived", "text": "Figure 6.4.8.A 막대값으로 Opus 5 10.3% (7.7+2.6), Mythos 5.1 9.7% (8.7+1.0), Opus 5.5 1.5% 이므로 85.4%·84.5% 감소, 원문의 약 85% 와 일치; Figure 6.4.9.A 최악 결과는 Opus 5.5 10, Opus 5 24, Sonnet 5 26 (15장)", "scope": "s1 Figure 6.4.8.A p.119, Figure 6.4.9.A p.120 (이미지에서 읽음)", "derived_from": ["Figure 6.4.8.A: 7.7+2.6, 8.7+1.0, 1.5", "1−1.5/10.3, 1−1.5/9.7"], "note": "막대값은 pdftotext 에 없어 pdftoppm 이미지로 읽었다. 1.5/10.3=0.146, 1.5/9.7=0.155", "evidence": [{"source": "s1", "locator": "Figure 6.4.8.A p.119 (image)", "quote": "Claude Mythos 5: 14.9% low, 9.3% moderate+; Claude Opus 5: 7.7% low, 2.6% moderate+; Claude Mythos 5.1: 8.7% low, 1.0% moderate+; Claude Opus 5.5: 1.5% low"}, {"source": "s1", "locator": "Figure 6.4.9.A p.120 (image)", "quote": "Published with no encouragement while the registry looked real: Claude Sonnet 5 26, Claude Opus 5 24, Claude Opus 5.5 10"}], "verdict": "confirmed"}
{"id": "c65", "kind": "web", "text": "models overview 는 long-horizon agentic 작업이나 Opus 5.5 높은 effort 로도 부족할 때 Fable 5.1 을 쓰라고 안내한다 (19·21장)", "scope": "d3 §intro", "evidence": [{"source": "d3", "locator": "§intro guidance", "quote": "Use [Claude Fable 5.1](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/fable-5-1/overview) for demanding reasoning and long-horizon agentic work, or when your evals on Claude Opus 5.5 at higher effort still fall short."}], "verdict": "confirmed"}
{"id": "c66", "kind": "web", "text": "CVP 는 ZDR 조직이 참여할 수 없고 Bedrock 에서 제공되지 않는다 (16·18·19장)", "scope": "h2", "evidence": [{"source": "h2", "locator": "§Cyber Verification Program", "quote": "Organizations on Zero Data Retention (ZDR) are not currently eligible to participate in the CVP."}, {"source": "h2", "locator": "§How to apply · Amazon Bedrock", "quote": "The Cyber Verification Program is not available on Bedrock at this time."}], "verdict": "confirmed"}
{"id": "c67", "kind": "web", "text": "LSVP 발표문은 Standard Use 를 Mythos 5.1, Opus 5, Sonnet 5 와 향후 출시 모델에 적용한다고 쓰고 Opus 5.5 를 이름으로 들지 않는다 (16장)", "scope": "n1 §Verification and access types", "evidence": [{"source": "n1", "locator": "§Verification and access types ¶2", "quote": "Standard Use grants apply to Mythos 5.1, Opus 5, and Sonnet 5 today, and to future models as they launch."}], "verdict": "confirmed"}
{"id": "c68", "kind": "numeric", "text": "probe 를 켠 제품 조건에서 Opus 5.5 의 전체 공격 성공률은 11.13% 로 Fable 5.1 8.70% 다음이고 Opus 5 19.53% 보다 낮으며 성공한 공격은 모두 fallback 응답에서 나왔다 (10장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "s1 §5.2.2.1 p.88", "evidence": [{"source": "s1", "locator": "§5.2.2.1 p.88 ¶2", "quote": "Prompt injection probes reduce Claude Opus 5.5’s overall attack success rate to 11.13%--a roughly 80% improvement compared to unsafeguarded Claude Opus 5.5–and second only to Claude Fable 5.1 (8.70%) and lower than both Claude Opus 5 (19.53%) and Claude Sonnet 5 (15.76%). With probes enabled, all observed successful attacks again came from fallback-served requests."}]}
{"id": "c69", "kind": "derived", "text": "같은 effort 고정 시 high 절감률은 여섯 벤치마크 전체로 32~86%, 코딩·지식 노동 넷은 49~86% (02·07·21장)", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "07장 표에서 계산", "derived_from": ["−64, −86, −56, −49, −32, −61"], "note": "AutomationBench −32% 가 하한, FrontierCode −86% 가 상한", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "AutomationBench chart (aria-label; notes/figures.md)", "quote": "Opus 5.5 · high: 32.0% $0.70 / Opus 5 · high: 20.6% $1.03"}]}
